OL,3,GNEWSAAuthority could hire event
OL,4,Amanagers for state visits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council's plan to hire a company to
OL,7,Fmanage its role at major events,
OL,8,Fincluding at Windsor Castle, is set to
OL,9,Fget the go-ahead.
OL,11,FThe Royal Borough for Windsor and
OL,12,FMaidenhead (RBWM) said it had a "key
OL,13,Frole" in supporting state events, but
OL,14,Femploying specialists full-time was too
OL,15,Fexpensive.
OL,17,FIt proposed signing an initial 10-year
OL,18,Fcontract with event managers to ensure
OL,19,Fit "can respond quickly and
OL,20,Feffectively".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
